heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3513474856","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112517#issuecomment-3513474856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112517","id":3513474856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ra18o","user":{"login":"MotasemZakarneh","id":46475130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDc1MTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46475130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh","html_url":"https://github.com/MotasemZakarneh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T19:08:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T19:11:44Z","body":"I managed to record a video with my phone, it was large, so i uploaded it to youtube.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/7cVlFIkt94Y\n\nbasically, focus really closely, on the distance between the two files that are visible, you'll see it shrinks and expand.\nmy test was basically click randomly between the three windows, noting that sometimes this small \"jitter\" happened even when i was only moving the mouse/hovering across elements.\n\nOne more note, it did not show up on my mac book air sequila.\n\n<img width=\"497\" height=\"263\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b34f1e8-ce55-440b-84a9-13137665c4fc\" />\n\nThis is my GPU btw.\n\n-----\n```Is it a really small (1 or 2 pixels) jitter? Or something visibly larger?```\ni can't really tell how much, but its definitely noticeable.\n\n```Does it happen on the window? On a specific Godot element?```\n\nit was hard to tell on the inspector, but i assume it did make an effect there.\nHowever, it definitely effects FileSystem and Scene windows.\n\n--------\nSingle window mode is off.\ni tried turning it on, and it had no difference.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3513474856/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3523746366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112517#issuecomment-3523746366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112517","id":3523746366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SCBo-","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T20:18:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T20:18:47Z","body":"Thanks for the details! Just remembered another possible detail that might be important; can you check if there's any resolution scaling in both Godot and Windows? If yes, can you try resetting to 100% temporarily to see if the issue goes away? You can check and change this:\n- In Godot: **Editor** > **Editor Settings** > **Interface** > **Editor** > **Display Scale**\n- In Windows: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/change-your-screen-resolution-and-layout-in-windows-5effefe3-2eac-e306-0b5d-2073b765876b","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3523746366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3526695662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112517#issuecomment-3526695662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112517","id":3526695662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SNRru","user":{"login":"MotasemZakarneh","id":46475130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDc1MTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46475130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh","html_url":"https://github.com/MotasemZakarneh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T09:22:09Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T09:23:03Z","body":"https://youtu.be/dB2Wsm2VOQM\n\ni reverted the editor scaling and windows scaling to 100, and there is still some weird artificats, you can see the font acting up on the files names.\nand very minor jittering of that same previous type?\ni have a 2k display (16/10 aspect ratio)(but it also happened on my external display which is also 2k but 16/9 aspect), so without scaling its not really workable, and was harder to see, but something is definitely not correct if that makes sense.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3526695662/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4026267994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112517#issuecomment-4026267994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112517","id":4026267994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v-_la","user":{"login":"VulumeCode","id":2590984,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTA5ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2590984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode","html_url":"https://github.com/VulumeCode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T19:37:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T21:08:49Z","body":"It's the GPU. I have it too. I've got the same issue in Photoshop. \n\nI've found some solutions: \n\n- In NVIDIA app, System, Display Mode: if it's 'Optimus', set it to \"NVIDIA GPU\" or \"Auto\". This affects your whole PC. Some other things might run worse or better without Optimus, and it'll affect power usage depending on which GPU \"Auto\" chooses. You can enable a tray icon to easily change this though.\n- In the Godot editor settings, turn on \"Update Continuously\". Can waste some power.\n- In Windows Settings, Display, Graphics, Add your .exe and and set GPU preference to your integrated GPU. A shame of your $500 GPU.\n\nSeems like it happens when it switches power modes. Hope NVidia gets around to fixing this. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4026267994/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030022652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112517#issuecomment-4030022652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112517","id":4030022652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wNUP8","user":{"login":"MotasemZakarneh","id":46475130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDc1MTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46475130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh","html_url":"https://github.com/MotasemZakarneh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MotasemZakarneh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T09:44:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T09:44:11Z","body":"> It's the GPU. I have it too. I've got the same issue in Photoshop.\n> \n> I've found some solutions:\n> \n> * In NVIDIA app, System, Display Mode: if it's 'Optimus', set it to \"NVIDIA GPU\" or \"Auto\". This affects your whole PC. Some other things might run worse or better without Optimus, and it'll affect power usage depending on which GPU \"Auto\" chooses. You can enable a tray icon to easily change this though.\n> * In the Godot editor settings, turn on \"Update Continuously\". Can waste some power.\n> * In Windows Settings, Display, Graphics, Add your .exe and and set GPU preference to your integrated GPU. A shame of your $500 GPU.\n> \n> Seems like it happens when it switches power modes. Hope NVidia gets around to fixing this.\n\n\n\nCan confirm:\nIf i turn on Update Continiously it works.\nIf i go to Settings/Display/Graphics add godot's.exe and setting it to use the AMD GPU (integrated), the issue no longer happens.\n\nI tried each one of these three separately, the first one had no effect for me, but the last two, worked for me.\n\nConsidering, i work a lot of time on battery and i don't use high end 3D Features, im opting to use the latter (setting the GPU to AMD).\n\nBut yeah, that was really unexpected thanks a lot.\ni hope it gets fixed at some point.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030022652/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030333386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112517#issuecomment-4030333386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112517","id":4030333386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wOgHK","user":{"login":"VulumeCode","id":2590984,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTA5ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2590984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode","html_url":"https://github.com/VulumeCode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulumeCode/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T10:29:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T10:29:38Z","body":"@MotasemZakarneh Glad I could help! Just checking, did you restart godot after disabling Optimus? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"